[ti:Dear Zoo]
[al:lesson l14]
[offset:0]
[00:12.02]I wrote to the zoo to send me a pet.
[00:16.72]They sent me an elephant.
[00:24.02]He was too big! I sent him back.
[00:31.38]So they sent me a giraffe.
[00:38.38]He was too tall! I sent him back.
[00:44.96]So they sent me a lion.
[00:53.70]He was too fierce! I sent him back.
[00:59.72]So they sent me a camel.
[01:06.22]He was too grumpy! I sent him back.
[01:12.66]So they sent me a snake.
[01:20.68]He was too scary! I sent him back.
[01:27.70]So they sent me a monkey.
[01:35.78]He was too naughty! I sent him back.
[01:41.90]So they sent me a frog.
[01:49.84]He was too jumpy! I sent him back.
[01:55.82]So they thought very hard, and sent me a dog.
[02:05.66]He was perfect! I kept him.
